scoring/imagereward.py builds the model of the image-reward package (https://github.com/THUDM/ImageReward, Apache
License 2.0) from local files; its init_tokenizer reproduces the package's models/BLIP/blip.py init_tokenizer
(ImageReward's BLIP code is adapted from https://github.com/salesforce/BLIP, BSD 3-Clause License).

The metric implementations in this directory (scoring/common.py, scoring/hpsv3.py, scoring/pickscore.py,
scoring/aesthetic.py, scoring/hpsv2.py, scoring/imagereward.py, scoring/clip.py) port the scoring formulas and
preprocessing of CDM's evaluation code,
cdm/rewards/{rewards,hpsv3_scorer,pickscore_scorer,aesthetic_scorer,hpsv2_scorer,imagereward_scorer,clip_scorer}.py
